Scope of this license
---------------------
This CC BY-NC 4.0 license covers the SOURCE CODE and reference `.mat` files
redistributed in this repository, specifically:

  - the Python modules under `src/`,
  - the Jupyter notebooks under `notebooks/`,
  - the repository-level configuration files,
  - the reference `.mat` files included under `data/` and generated by the
    author (`NLS_N1.mat`, `NLS_N2.mat`, `Bright_soliton.mat`).

It does NOT cover:

  - The thesis document itself, registered at TESIUNAM under
    Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 International
    (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0):
      https://hdl.handle.net/20.500.14330/TES01000894006
      https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0

  - The reference `.mat` files that are NOT redistributed in this repository
    (`NLS_2soliton_interaction.mat`, `hirota_N_2.mat`, `N_2_hirota_inter.mat`).
    Access is granted on request by email to
    `aron.contreras@atmosfera.unam.mx` (see README §7). Reuse conditions are
    set by Dr. L. Serkin on a case-by-case basis for the Hirota solutions.

